OL,3,GNEWSA'She was trying to get better' -
OL,4,Athe lives lost to drug overdoses
OL,5,
OL,6,F"She had a heart of gold. She just
OL,7,Fcouldn't, unfortunately, help herself."
OL,9,FStanding in the grounds of Belfast City
OL,10,FHall, Jenna McCune's family remember
OL,11,Fthe woman behind the photograph.
OL,13,FThe 35-year-old mother-of-two died from
OL,14,Fa drugs overdose in Belfast on 31 March
OL,15,F2021.
OL,17,FFive years on, her family are still
OL,18,Flearning how to live with her loss.
